🔥 Best Practices

✅ Keep modules small (single responsibility)
✅ Avoid hardcoding
✅ Use variables
✅ Output required values
✅ Version control modules

⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Putting everything in one module
❌ Hardcoding values
❌ Not using outputs
❌ Tight coupling between modules

